@startuml
title idempotent-component v2 - Full State Model (Shard-Ready Storage)

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
' Prefer natural polyline routing over rigid orthogonal channels.
' The full-state diagram contains several fan-out/fan-in areas; polyline keeps
' semantic groups readable and avoids forcing unrelated edges into one grid.
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 75
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
left to right direction

legend
[PERSISTED]   = IdempotencyStatus，真正写入 JDBC / Redis
[DERIVED]     = 由当前记录 + 时间 + failureRetryable 计算，不写入 status 字段
[REPO RESULT] = Repository 原子操作返回值
[CALL RESULT] = IdempotencyExecutor / IdempotencyOperations 对上层返回值
[DOC ONLY]    = 为解释生命周期增加的概念节点，不是代码枚举
endlegend

' ============================================================================
' 1. Persisted lifecycle
'    Layout intent: keep the acquire/execute spine horizontal; terminal states
'    are allowed to float naturally instead of forcing a strict grid.
' ============================================================================
state "ABSENT\n[DOC ONLY]\n尚无物理记录" as ABSENT
state "PROCESSING\n[PERSISTED]\nIdempotencyStatus.PROCESSING\nownerToken + version\nprocessingExpireAt" as PROCESSING
state "SUCCESS\n[PERSISTED]\nIdempotencyStatus.SUCCESS\n业务真实成功\noptional resultPayload" as SUCCESS
state "FAILED\n[PERSISTED]\nIdempotencyStatus.FAILED\nfailureRetryable" as FAILED
state "DISCARDED\n[PERSISTED]\nIdempotencyStatus.DISCARDED\n明确终止，不再处理" as DISCARDED

[*] -right-> ABSENT
ABSENT -right-> PROCESSING : tryAcquire = ACQUIRED\n首次原子抢占\nowner=A, version=1

PROCESSING --> SUCCESS : markSuccess\nownerToken + version CAS\nWriteStatus=UPDATED
PROCESSING --> FAILED : markFailed\nownerToken + version CAS\nWriteStatus=UPDATED
PROCESSING --> DISCARDED : markDiscarded\nownerToken + version CAS\nWriteStatus=UPDATED

' Recovery creates a new generation, not a fifth persisted state.
PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : recover expired PROCESSING\nexpectedOwner/version match\nnew owner + version+1
FAILED --> PROCESSING : recover retryable FAILED\nexpectedOwner/version match\nnew owner + version+1

' ============================================================================
' 2. Normal execute() derived decisions
'    Duplicate/derived branches deliberately drop below persisted states so
'    they do not compete with the main acquire -> execute -> business spine.
' ============================================================================
state "PROCESSING_ACTIVE\n[DERIVED]\nAcquireStatus.PROCESSING_ACTIVE\nprocessingExpireAt > now" as D_ACTIVE
state "PROCESSING_EXPIRED\n[DERIVED]\nAcquireStatus.PROCESSING_EXPIRED\nprocessingExpireAt <= now" as D_EXPIRED
state "FAILED_RETRYABLE\n[DERIVED]\nAcquireStatus.FAILED_RETRYABLE\nfailureRetryable=true" as D_FAILED_RETRYABLE
state "FAILED_FINAL\n[DERIVED]\nAcquireStatus.FAILED_FINAL\nfailureRetryable=false" as D_FAILED_FINAL
state "HISTORICAL_SUCCESS\n[REPO RESULT]\nAcquireStatus.SUCCESS" as A_SUCCESS
state "HISTORICAL_DISCARDED\n[REPO RESULT]\nAcquireStatus.DISCARDED" as A_DISCARDED
state "KEY_CONFLICT\n[REPO RESULT]\nAcquireStatus.KEY_CONFLICT" as A_CONFLICT
state "PROVIDER_ERROR\n[REPO RESULT]\nAcquireStatus.PROVIDER_ERROR" as A_ERROR

PROCESSING -down-> D_ACTIVE : normal duplicate\nnow < processingExpireAt
PROCESSING -down-> D_EXPIRED : normal duplicate\nnow >= processingExpireAt
FAILED -down-> D_FAILED_RETRYABLE : failureRetryable=true
FAILED -down-> D_FAILED_FINAL : failureRetryable=false
SUCCESS -down-> A_SUCCESS : duplicate execute()
DISCARDED -down-> A_DISCARDED : duplicate execute()

state "EXECUTE\n[CORE ACTION]\nStateMachine.execute()" as ACTION_EXECUTE
state "REPLAY\n[CORE ACTION]\nStateMachine.replay()" as ACTION_REPLAY
state "RETURN\n[CORE ACTION]\nStateMachine.returning(...)" as ACTION_RETURN

PROCESSING -right-> ACTION_EXECUTE : tryAcquire=ACQUIRED\n仅新 generation
A_SUCCESS -right-> ACTION_REPLAY : SUCCESS
A_DISCARDED -right-> ACTION_RETURN : PREVIOUS_DISCARDED
D_ACTIVE -right-> ACTION_RETURN : PROCESSING
D_EXPIRED -right-> ACTION_RETURN : PROCESSING_EXPIRED
D_FAILED_RETRYABLE -right-> ACTION_RETURN : PREVIOUS_FAILED_RETRYABLE
D_FAILED_FINAL -right-> ACTION_RETURN : PREVIOUS_FAILED_FINAL
A_CONFLICT -right-> ACTION_RETURN : KEY_CONFLICT
A_ERROR -right-> ACTION_RETURN : REPOSITORY_ERROR

state "BUSINESS CALLBACK\ncurrent owner/version\nrecoveryExecution=false/true" as BUSINESS
ACTION_EXECUTE -right-> BUSINESS
ACTION_REPLAY --> SUCCESS : 不重新执行业务\n读取历史成功语义/结果

' ============================================================================
' 3. Completion / write CAS results
'    UPDATED stays on the business spine. Exceptional CAS results fan downward
'    and converge only after their repository meanings are visible.
' ============================================================================
state "UPDATED\n[REPO RESULT]\nWriteStatus.UPDATED" as W_UPDATED
state "STALE_OWNER\n[REPO RESULT]\nWriteStatus.STALE_OWNER" as W_STALE
state "ALREADY_FINAL\n[REPO RESULT]\nWriteStatus.ALREADY_FINAL" as W_FINAL
state "NOT_FOUND\n[REPO RESULT]\nWriteStatus.NOT_FOUND" as W_NOT_FOUND
state "WRITE_PROVIDER_ERROR\n[REPO RESULT]\nWriteStatus.PROVIDER_ERROR" as W_ERROR

BUSINESS -right-> W_UPDATED : markSuccess / markFailed\n或 low-level markDiscarded\nCAS 命中
BUSINESS -down-> W_STALE : owner/version 已换代
BUSINESS -down-> W_FINAL : 当前记录已终态
BUSINESS -down-> W_NOT_FOUND : 记录不存在
BUSINESS -down-> W_ERROR : Provider exception

W_UPDATED --> SUCCESS : markSuccess
W_UPDATED --> FAILED : markFailed
W_UPDATED --> DISCARDED : markDiscarded\nIdempotencyOperations/message path

state "OWNERSHIP_LOST\n[CALL RESULT]\nIdempotencyResultStatus.OWNERSHIP_LOST" as R_OWNERSHIP_LOST
state "REPOSITORY_ERROR\n[CALL RESULT]\nIdempotencyResultStatus.REPOSITORY_ERROR" as R_REPOSITORY_ERROR
W_STALE -right-> R_OWNERSHIP_LOST : Executor completion rejected
W_FINAL -right-> R_OWNERSHIP_LOST : Executor completion rejected
W_NOT_FOUND -right-> R_REPOSITORY_ERROR
W_ERROR -right-> R_REPOSITORY_ERROR

note bottom of W_STALE
Tx-B 场景：markSuccess 返回 STALE_OWNER / ALREADY_FINAL 时，
Executor 会抛 CompletionRejectedException 强制回滚业务事务，
防止旧 generation 的业务 SQL 提交。
end note

' ============================================================================
' 4. Reliable Recovery: scan candidate -> second CAS -> new generation
'    Recovery is intentionally pushed below the normal duplicate branches.
'    The decision node may fan naturally; do not force all outcomes through
'    shared orthogonal channels.
' ============================================================================
state "RECOVERY_CANDIDATE\n[DOC ONLY]\nPROCESSING_EXPIRED\n或 FAILED_RETRYABLE\n由 storeName + scanBucket 扫描" as REC_CANDIDATE
state "RECOVERY_ATOMIC_DECISION\nRepository.tryRecover()\nexpectedOwner + expectedVersion" as REC_DECISION <<choice>>
state "RECOVERY_ACQUIRED\n[REPO RESULT]\nnew owner + version+1" as REC_ACQUIRED
state "STALE_CANDIDATE\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.STALE_CANDIDATE" as REC_STALE
state "NOT_RECOVERABLE\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.NOT_RECOVERABLE" as REC_NOT_ALLOWED
state "REC_PROCESSING_ACTIVE\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.PROCESSING_ACTIVE" as REC_ACTIVE
state "REC_FAILED_FINAL\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.FAILED_FINAL" as REC_FAILED_FINAL
state "REC_SUCCESS\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.SUCCESS" as REC_SUCCESS
state "REC_DISCARDED\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.DISCARDED" as REC_DISCARDED
state "REC_NOT_FOUND\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.NOT_FOUND" as REC_NOT_FOUND
state "REC_KEY_CONFLICT\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.KEY_CONFLICT" as REC_CONFLICT
state "REC_PROVIDER_ERROR\n[REPO RESULT]\nRecoveryStatus.PROVIDER_ERROR" as REC_ERROR

D_EXPIRED -down-> REC_CANDIDATE : recoveryMode=EXTERNAL_TASK\nrecoverProcessingTimeout=true
D_FAILED_RETRYABLE -down-> REC_CANDIDATE : recoveryMode=EXTERNAL_TASK\nrecoverFailed=true
REC_CANDIDATE -right-> REC_DECISION : recover(expectedOwner, expectedVersion)

REC_DECISION --> REC_ACQUIRED : 仍是可恢复旧 generation
REC_DECISION --> REC_STALE : owner/version 已变化
REC_DECISION --> REC_NOT_ALLOWED : recoveryMode/window/rule 不允许
REC_DECISION --> REC_ACTIVE : PROCESSING 尚未超时
REC_DECISION --> REC_FAILED_FINAL : FAILED 不可恢复
REC_DECISION --> REC_SUCCESS : 当前已 SUCCESS
REC_DECISION --> REC_DISCARDED : 当前已 DISCARDED
REC_DECISION --> REC_NOT_FOUND : record missing
REC_DECISION --> REC_CONFLICT : storage/route/hash conflict
REC_DECISION --> REC_ERROR : provider error

REC_ACQUIRED --> PROCESSING : 原子接管\nnew owner + version+1
REC_ACQUIRED --> ACTION_EXECUTE : StateMachine EXECUTE\nrecoveryExecution=true
REC_SUCCESS --> ACTION_REPLAY : StateMachine REPLAY
REC_DISCARDED --> ACTION_RETURN : PREVIOUS_DISCARDED
REC_ACTIVE --> ACTION_RETURN : PROCESSING
REC_NOT_ALLOWED --> ACTION_RETURN : RECOVERY_NOT_ALLOWED
REC_FAILED_FINAL --> ACTION_RETURN : RECOVERY_NOT_ALLOWED
REC_NOT_FOUND --> ACTION_RETURN : RECOVERY_NOT_ALLOWED
REC_STALE --> ACTION_RETURN : STALE_RECOVERY_CANDIDATE
REC_CONFLICT --> ACTION_RETURN : KEY_CONFLICT
REC_ERROR --> ACTION_RETURN : REPOSITORY_ERROR

note bottom of REC_CANDIDATE
candidate 只是扫描时的快照，不是执行许可。
真正执行前必须再次 tryRecover(expectedOwner, expectedVersion)。
扫描调度 / MQ 投递不属于 idempotent-core。
end note

' ============================================================================
' 5. WINDOWED overlay
'    Keep the window lifecycle on the outside of the core execution/recovery
'    graph. These are overlay semantics, not another execution decision chain.
' ============================================================================
state "WINDOW_ACTIVE\n[DOC ONLY]\nnow < windowExpireAt" as WINDOW_ACTIVE
state "WINDOW_EXPIRED\n[DOC ONLY]\nnow >= windowExpireAt" as WINDOW_EXPIRED
state "NEW_GENERATION\n[DOC ONLY]\nnext execute()\nversion+1" as WINDOW_NEW

WINDOW_ACTIVE -right-> WINDOW_ACTIVE : duplicate access\nFIXED: 不推进\nSLIDING: 推进 windowExpireAt
WINDOW_ACTIVE -right-> WINDOW_EXPIRED : now >= windowExpireAt
WINDOW_EXPIRED -right-> WINDOW_NEW : next normal tryAcquire()
WINDOW_NEW --> PROCESSING : 同一物理记录重置为 PROCESSING\nversion+1

PROCESSING -up-> WINDOW_ACTIVE : WINDOWED only
SUCCESS -up-> WINDOW_ACTIVE : WINDOWED only
FAILED -up-> WINDOW_ACTIVE : WINDOWED only
DISCARDED -up-> WINDOW_ACTIVE : WINDOWED only

note bottom of WINDOW_EXPIRED
语义窗口结束 != 物理记录删除。
记录可在 recordRetentionTtl 内继续保留。
下一次 execute() 可在同一行开启新 generation。

特别注意：PROCESSING_EXPIRED 本身不会自动延长 sliding window。
end note

' ============================================================================
' 6. Public call result projection
' ============================================================================
note as EXECUTOR_RESULTS
IdempotencyResultStatus（高层 Executor，一次调用结果，不持久化）

成功：
- EXECUTED
- RECOVERED
- REPLAYED

历史/状态返回：
- PREVIOUS_DISCARDED
- PROCESSING
- PROCESSING_EXPIRED
- PREVIOUS_FAILED_RETRYABLE
- PREVIOUS_FAILED_FINAL
- RECOVERY_NOT_ALLOWED
- STALE_RECOVERY_CANDIDATE
- KEY_CONFLICT

执行 / 事务：
- LOCK_NOT_ACQUIRED
- EXECUTION_FAILED
- TRANSACTION_FAILED
- TRANSACTION_COMMIT_UNKNOWN
- OWNERSHIP_LOST

结果策略 / 存储 / 校验：
- RESULT_POLICY_ERROR
- RESULT_REPLAY_UNAVAILABLE
- RESULT_POLICY_MISMATCH
- REPOSITORY_ERROR
- VALIDATION_FAILED
end note

note as OPERATION_RESULTS
IdempotencyOperations（给 message/task/workflow 的低层状态 API）

Acquire projection：
- ACQUIRED
- DUPLICATE_SUCCESS
- DUPLICATE_DISCARDED
- PROCESSING
- PROCESSING_EXPIRED
- FAILED_RETRYABLE
- FAILED_FINAL
- KEY_CONFLICT
- STORAGE_ERROR

Write projection：
- UPDATED
- STALE_OWNER
- ALREADY_FINAL
- NOT_FOUND
- STORAGE_ERROR

它们是 API 投影，不是 IdempotencyStatus。
end note

note as STORAGE_NOTE
Storage Identity / Routing

逻辑唯一身份：
storeName + namespace + idempotencyKey

执行期路由与扫描元数据：
StorageRoute = online physical routing
scanBucket   = recovery scan routing

同一幂等身份跨 generation 的 scanBucket 不允许漂移，漂移 -> KEY_CONFLICT。
物理分片由 StorageRouteContext 绑定，不写入幂等记录。

routeKey / requestHash 是业务身份保护；
Repository 仍通过 UNIQUE / row lock / Lua / owner-version CAS 保证正确性。
end note

@enduml
